{
  "about": "Streamed answers in both wire formats. Feed the joined lines (with lineEnding, default \\n) to the SSE parser in chunks of any size, decode each event, apply them to an answer: expect its text, stop reason, token counts, whether the stream ended, whether thinking was seen; or the error kind thrown (after the text before it).",
